Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Track 2: Work Being a Drag? (tentative)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.34,0:01:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.15,0:01:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute, Sensei,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.97,0:01:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,are you trying to pretend not to notice?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.20,0:01:54.55,Default,,0,0,0,,That's pretty mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.65,0:02:02.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I made the arduous journey{遠路はるばる} of coming all the way to Schale,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.09,0:02:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You're really not going to take even a peek at your cute little student{reword}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.52,0:02:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,and just keep working?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.62,0:02:19.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you always brush everyone off like this when you're busy?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.45,0:02:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,If not that...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.06,0:02:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I the only one you act like this around,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.83,0:02:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,perhaps?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.58,0:02:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,まあ、意地をはるならはるで、構いませんよ。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.88,0:02:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,それを堕落させるために、こうして来ているわけですからね。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.89,0:02:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,With that said, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.42,0:02:54.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here to woo you over,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.83,0:02:58.49,Default,,0,0,0,,not be mean to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.79,0:03:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.80,0:03:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,If you really don't like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.89,0:03:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't get in your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.77,0:03:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Comment: 0,0:03:18.19,0:03:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.79,0:03:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't look like you've moved your pen for a while now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.17,0:03:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Is something wrong, Sensei?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.35,0:03:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, if you're really in a pinch,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.57,0:03:41.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't mind helping you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.90,0:03:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,As a fellow middle manager myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.76,0:03:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I share your pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.15,0:03:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,At the very least,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.07,0:03:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I should be able to relate more than others.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.25,0:04:02.55,Default,,0,0,0,,But, Sensei...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.08,0:04:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,先ほどから、少しモニターを見てはスマホを取り出し
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.20,0:04:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,ちょっとキーボードを叩いては
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.22,0:04:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,staring at the ceiling...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.17,0:04:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like you're not very focused on the work at hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.91,0:04:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.14,0:04:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.48,0:04:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.78,0:04:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.41,0:04:44.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Or maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.61,0:04:49.35,Default,,0,0,0,,your ability to concentrate has reached its limit?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.67,0:04:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I know how you feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.83,0:05:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're tired, not being able to move your hand
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.28,0:05:04.27,Default,,0,0,0,,is just a matter of fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.81,0:05:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You're tired of working, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.95,0:05:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,やる気は待ってても来ないもの、
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.88,0:05:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,そのやる気を出すには、手を動かすことから〜
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.15,0:05:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,などと言いますが
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.50,0:05:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,そうして最初の一歩を踏み出すのは
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.85,0:05:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,is always the toughest part.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.23,0:05:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,At times like those
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.78,0:05:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,there's nothing you can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.95,0:05:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,How about it, Sensei?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.00,0:05:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't we go over there and take a nice little break?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.14,0:05:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no one around.\NIt's the perfect opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.92,0:06:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure your body is exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.49,0:06:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,How about we go stretch yourself out on that sofa?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.45,0:06:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.03,0:06:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just a few minutes of relaxation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.26,0:06:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody will yell at you for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.27,0:06:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, the only one who has eyes on you is me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.38,0:06:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.01,0:06:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll even add a special service on top.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.08,0:06:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,中間管理職同士の好で
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.84,0:06:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,優しくしてあげますよ
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.58,0:07:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll even feed you a little snack with this very hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.31,0:07:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,And if you do what I'm telling you to do now,{それに、今私の言うことを聞いてくれるなら}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.39,0:07:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,私も先生の言うこと
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.30,0:07:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,聞いてあげてもいいですone thing of your bidding
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.92,0:07:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Just one, though, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.69,0:07:33.19,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.35,0:07:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.90,0:07:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.29,0:07:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,you might get motivated again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.55,0:07:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So how about it, Sensei?
Comment: 0,0:07:56.09,0:07:56.73,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.35,0:08:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Good grief. You sure are a tough nut to crack.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.04,0:08:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,そこまでして、意地でも私の方を見ようとしないのは
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.80,0:08:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,先生としてのプライド…なんでしょうか？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.41,0:08:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,How admirable.{rephrase}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.52,0:08:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.20,0:08:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's a good thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.45,0:08:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,As a teacher, it's very praiseworthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.92,0:08:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,But your ears...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.98,0:08:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,are flush red.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.60,0:08:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,That said,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.12,0:08:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,it appears I'm also running out of gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.12,0:09:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,もうこういうのやめて
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.10,0:09:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,だらけてしまいたいところなのですが
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.50,0:09:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It appears our Sensei has an obsession for working.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.78,0:09:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.22,0:09:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,何があっても立ち上がらないと
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.30,0:09:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,となると
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.75,0:09:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}soudesune{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.52,0:09:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay there and don't move an inch, Sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.08,0:09:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.55,0:09:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.27,0:09:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,「何」と言われましても
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.86,0:09:57.93,Default,,0,0,0,,先生のオモリになって上げてるんですよ。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.72,0:10:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, it looks like your priorities
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.52,0:10:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,lie with work instead of your cute student.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.30,0:10:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to keep an eye on you
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.04,0:10:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,so that you don't run away
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.74,0:10:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,言い訳できないようにしてあげようかな〜
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.14,0:10:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,At least that's what I had in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.58,0:10:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.38,0:10:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.07,0:10:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You get work done. Someone looks after you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.44,0:10:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I get to loaf around.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.33,0:10:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That's three birds with one stone!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.87,0:10:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.67,0:10:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there something else troubling you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.00,0:10:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,私、結構軽い方だと思うんですけど
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.85,0:11:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,ならいいじゃないですか。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.99,0:11:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,あとでやり返したりしないでくださいよ
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.73,0:11:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,この形なら良いですが
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.17,0:11:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,逆だとちょっと心配になるので
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.08,0:11:27.67,Default,,0,0,0,,ほらほら、そんなこと言ってる場合ですか？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.85,0:11:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Instead of paying attention to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.91,0:11:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,hurry up and get back to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.92,0:11:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,"Don't slack off," right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.64,0:12:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You made a mistake there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.29,0:12:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you tallying up the wrong lines?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.66,0:12:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,いいえ、大したことではないので。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.61,0:12:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,The fact that you're starting to misread things
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.52,0:12:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,makes it pretty evident that you're tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.19,0:12:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,少し休んだほうが、すっきりして
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.30,0:12:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,仕事の処理も早くなるかもしれませんよ？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.96,0:12:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,まあ別に、私はこのままでも一向に構いませんが
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.88,0:12:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,大丈夫ですよ。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.40,0:12:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,無理やり先生の体を同行
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.61,0:13:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,と言ったような直接的な邪魔をしませんので
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.60,0:13:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,触接的なものは、ですけどね？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.07,0:13:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, I read in some book that
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.20,0:13:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,imperative statements in the negative tend to have
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.32,0:13:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,,a boomerang effect on the brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.51,0:13:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,For example、こうして「サボっちゃダメ」、
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.03,0:14:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,と言われると、「サボる」という単語の方が
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.79,0:14:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,脳に結びついて
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.50,0:14:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,離れなくなってしまうんだとか
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.76,0:14:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,So what I'm saying is, don't take a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.87,0:14:15.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't slack off.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.72,0:14:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't give in to Iroha.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.97,0:14:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, you'll start thinking,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.13,0:14:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,"I wanna take a break,"
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.15,0:14:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,"I wanna slack off,"
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.15,0:14:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,"I wanna give in,"
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.98,0:14:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,as a result of your brain converting them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.56,0:14:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,私のことも「気にしない気にしない」と思ったところで
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.83,0:14:55.05,Default,,0,0,0,,ほ〜ら、もう今既に逃げられなくなってるんじゃないですか？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.35,0:15:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,この状況、先生はどこまで耐えられますかね？
